# L §3.2: "A num CUR becomes money only through round(x, u, mode) with u a whole number of minor units
# (minor(PLN), §7.2)".  10.00 PLN × 0.123 = 1.23 PLN exactly; × 0.1234 = 1.234 → half-even to 0.01: 1.23 PLN.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "a source"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
unit EUR: currency minor 0.01
unit hour "godzina"

input a: money PLN
input x: num

def b: money PLN at reader
  rule base = round(a * x, minor(PLN), half-even)

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  a = 10.00 PLN
  x = 0.1234

ask q1: b law 2026-06-30
=== expect
q1: 1.23 PLN
  law date 2026-06-30, cut 2026-01-01
